  "description": "Drop-in traffic dashboard and self-discovering API documentation UI for ASP.NET Web API 2 (OWIN) and ASP.NET Core applications - no Swagger/OpenAPI spec required. Adds a live request-tracking dashboard (hits/success/fail, hourly charts, per-endpoint drill-down with request/response payload capture), a fully custom, brandable documentation page that discovers endpoints and infers schemas from real captured traffic, and an opt-in browser-based load-testing companion tool - no external services, no build tooling required.",
  "id": "ApiVista",
